\ An explicit argument whose expected type is a pi with an implicit binder:
\ Lean adds an implicit lambda and accepts (theorem t_impl : True :=
\ IL.impl IL.z, tests/front/implicit-lambda.lean); LeanForth does not add one
\ yet and stops, not supported (error 133, plan FE2; src/front/elab-app.fs
\ ea-no-lambda?), never accepting what it has not elaborated as Lean does.
theorem t_impl
  True
:=
  ' IL.z IL.impl
end t_impl
